{"c":[{"id":"cb6ae39a5d37dae5","sum":"L4 release PR is a child whose tip drops memory-bank/active, so main stays a Fresh /niko checkout. Do not merge that child back. After land, restore memory-bank/active onto a branch from main. Rebase onto the squash. A merge-commit rebase ends on main and drops the memory bank.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261023T170937Z-2ed4854315f18992","text":"Operator 2026-10-23: a mid-L4 release PR is a child of the working branch whose tip drops memory-bank/active, so main stays a Fresh /niko checkout. Do not merge that child back; the deletion would remove the working memory bank.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261023T174008Z-2f2719b3d24475d2","text":"After PR 150 lands, restore memory-bank/active from constrain-size-as-best-we-can onto a branch from main. Rebase onto the squash conflicts; a merge-commit rebase ends on main and drops the memory bank.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"8afc0a8c1d95c4dc","sum":"Operator 2026-10-23: docs state the current system; history separate or omitted. Make tables are indexes. Procedures are numbered STE100 steps. Architecture states migration cutoffs and the schema snapshot, not filenames or schema versions. Schema-docs names diagram's sources.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261023T185340Z-f0241d50f37fdbf8","text":"Operator 2026-10-23: user-facing docs describe the system as it is. History gets its own section or is omitted. Make tables are indexes. Critical procedures are short numbered STE100 steps.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261023T192936Z-7fa70422db429591","text":"Operator 2026-10-23: architecture states migration cutoffs and the schema snapshot, not filenames or schema versions. Contributing schema-docs says the diagram is generated and which sources to edit.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
